+\textbf{Start with the Argument}
+\begin{itemize}\setlength{\itemsep}{5pt}
+    \item Establish the claims, interpretation, and exhibits before drafting prose
+    \item State the economic argument directly for the intended reader
+    \item Verify findings and citations; never invent results
+\end{itemize}
+\vspace{0.2cm}
+\textbf{Reusable Writing Skills}
+\begin{itemize}\setlength{\itemsep}{2pt}
