+\end{itemize}
+\end{column}
+\begin{column}{0.48\textwidth}
+\textbf{Give Explicit Author Instructions}
+\begin{itemize}\setlength{\itemsep}{5pt}
+    \item Match the existing prose; make minimal edits
+    \item Avoid coined terms, stock trailing clauses, and contrastive padding
+    \item Keep chat history and internal workflow out of the paper
+    \item Introduce notation only when necessary; define every symbol
+    \item Recheck the prose: models can return to their default style
+\end{itemize}
+\end{column}
